+    THREE ENDS PER WORD, and the second is the one that makes the set honest:
+      * the gate lets a read-only command that names a protected path through,
+      * with that ONE word taken out of the reader's set the same line is refused again -- so an
+        entry that decides nothing cannot sit in the set unnoticed,
